    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start a Startup is a visual novel, a multi-ending story where your choices matter. <br>Answer questions about startups and business terminology to advance the plot and unlock new chapters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you advance the story through clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple endings, and the outcomes change according to the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find hints about the choices you will make throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with features: test your business knowledge with quizzes and fight off curses in a fun minigame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to be interested in startups or business to enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A university student is possessed by the ghost of the legendary feudal lord Oda Nobunaga, who teaches him how to conquer the business world and learn the basics of starting a startup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, what is a startup?:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a type of business that dares to change the world with innovative new goods and services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended for:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who are interested in forming a startup but don't know where to start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who are not interested in business but like visual novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who love Japanese culture, history, and visual novels.&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start a Startup is a visual novel, a multi-ending story where your choices matter. <br>Answer questions about startups and business terminology to advance the plot and unlock new chapters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you advance the story through clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple endings, and the outcomes change according to the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find hints about the choices you will make throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with features: test your business knowledge with quizzes and fight off curses in a fun minigame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to be interested in startups or business to enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A university student is possessed by the ghost of the legendary feudal lord Oda Nobunaga, who teaches him how to conquer the business world and learn the basics of starting a startup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, what is a startup?:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a type of business that dares to change the world with innovative new goods and services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended for:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who are interested in forming a startup but don't know where to start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who are not interested in business but like visual novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who love Japanese culture, history, and visual novels.&quot;</p>",
